{"provider":"github","id":"7231","externalId":"5801410038","revision":"2026-10-11T16:05:13Z","type":"issue","title":"readservice: scheduler-state projector swallows refresh errors silently","body":"**Problem:** the scheduler-state projector's `refresh` discards snapshot errors (`if err != nil { return }`) with no log or metric. On persistent failure the last good projection is served indefinitely and readers see stale scheduler state with no signal.\n\n**Location:** `internal/readservice/schedulerprojection.go:refresh`\n\n**Scope:** log (rate-limited / on state change) or record the refresh error, ignoring context cancellation at shutdown; optionally expose staleness.\n\n**Acceptance:** a failing snapshot produces an observable signal; test with a failing instanceLog snapshot; shutdown cancel stays silent.\n\nConfidence: moderate (lens: reliability). Source: quality-sprint collate.\nNomination key: qs/reliability/internal/readservice/schedulerprojection.go#refresh\n","labels":["area:telemetry","goobers:approved","goobers:ready","goobers:claimed","goobers:nominated","type:bug","goobers:cloud"],"state":"open","status":"open","links":[{"rel":"self","url":"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7231"}],"url":"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7231","createdAt":"2026-10-11T13:17:39Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-11T16:05:13Z","readyAt":"2026-10-11T13:40:57Z","fields":{"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-10-11T13:17:39Z","id":5801410038,"issue_dependencies_summary.total_blocked_by":0,"locked":false,"number":7231,"state":"open","title":"readservice: scheduler-state projector swallows refresh errors silently","updated_at":"2026-10-11T16:05:13Z","user.login":"goobersbot[bot]"},"raw":{"id":5801410038,"number":7231,"title":"readservice: scheduler-state projector swallows refresh errors silently","body":"**Problem:** the scheduler-state projector's `refresh` discards snapshot errors (`if err != nil { return }`) with no log or metric. On persistent failure the last good projection is served indefinitely and readers see stale scheduler state with no signal.\n\n**Location:** `internal/readservice/schedulerprojection.go:refresh`\n\n**Scope:** log (rate-limited / on state change) or record the refresh error, ignoring context cancellation at shutdown; optionally expose staleness.\n\n**Acceptance:** a failing snapshot produces an observable signal; test with a failing instanceLog snapshot; shutdown cancel stays silent.\n\nConfidence: moderate (lens: reliability). Source: quality-sprint collate.\nNomination key: qs/reliability/internal/readservice/schedulerprojection.go#refresh\n","state":"open","state_reason":"","locked":false,"comments":4,"html_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7231","user":{"login":"goobersbot[bot]","type":"Bot"},"labels":[{"name":"area:telemetry","color":"fbca04","description":"Run telemetry: spans, rollup store, query surface"},{"name":"goobers:approved","color":"0E8A16","description":"Maintainer-approved — eligible for curation/implementation (SEC-047)"},{"name":"goobers:ready","color":"1D76DB","description":"Curated and scoped — eligible for implementation"},{"name":"goobers:claimed","color":"FBCA04","description":"Currently claimed by an in-flight run"},{"name":"goobers:nominated","color":"5319E7","description":"Filed by the nominator — awaiting maintainer approval"},{"name":"type:bug","color":"D73A4A","description":"Defect in existing behavior"},{"name":"goobers:cloud","color":"1d76db","description":"Claim-partition: issue belongs to the cloud (Goobernetes) instance"}],"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"created_at":"2026-10-11T13:17:39Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T16:05:13Z","issue_dependencies_summary":{"total_blocked_by":0},"pull_request":null},"integrity":"maintainer"}